OL,3,AWhat is the Budget and what could be in
OL,4,Ait?
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey will set out
OL,7,FLabour's tax and spending plans when he
OL,8,Fdelivers his first Budget on 28
OL,9,FOctober.
OL,11,FHe has refused to rule out tax
OL,12,Fincreases after acknowledging
OL,13,Fgovernment borrowing costs are at
OL,14,F"historic highs".
OL,16,FBut the government's room for manoeuvre
OL,17,Fon tax is limited.
OL,19,FBefore the 2024 general election,
OL,20,FLabour promised not to increase three
OL,21,Fbig revenue earners for the government:
OL,22,Fincome tax, National Insurance and VAT.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
